# Combined monochrome/color shelf, portrait games, and Lynx.
press a
phase Shelf
press r1
press left
snap system-ws
press a
snap ws-shelf
press a
phase Playing 20000
wait 500
snap ws-color-landscape
press select
wait 500
snap ws-color-portrait
hold menu 1500
phase Shelf 20000
press right
snap ws-mono-cart
press a
phase Playing 20000
wait 500
snap ws-mono-landscape
hold menu 1500
phase Shelf 20000
press b
press right
snap system-lynx
press a
snap lynx-shelf
press a
phase Playing 20000
wait 500
snap lynx-landscape
press select
wait 500
snap lynx-portrait
hold menu 1500
phase Shelf 20000
